message: >-
  If you cite this repository, please cite the version you used and include its
  release DOI when one is available.
title: "Research Artifact Ledger"
authors:
  - family-names: Davis
    given-names: Richard George
date-released: 2026-10-08
version: 0.2.0
url: https://github.com/RichardGeorgeDavis/research-artifact-ledger
abstract: >-
  A versioned repository for bounded research artifacts with explicit source
  trails, evidence labels, reproduction notes, limitations, and correction
  history. Version 0.2.0 includes a reproduced finite negative prime-ranking
  screen; no general predictor or novelty claim is made.
